{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24892","headline":"乐天梦得有岁夜诗聊以奉和 · 牛僧孺","name":"乐天梦得有岁夜诗聊以奉和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惜岁岁今尽，少年应不知。\n凄凉数流辈，欢喜见孙儿。\n暗减一身力，潜添满鬓丝。\n莫愁花笑老，花自几多时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛僧孺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}